{"version":1,"content":"<p>在一系列技術故障擾亂美國航空、銀行和國家安全系統後，白宮國家網絡總監肖恩·凱恩克羅斯被解除職務。一位接近白宮的人士周四表示，美國總統特朗普「完全支持」解除凱恩克羅斯職務的決定。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587230.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.211206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:20:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"036c58c0fa9ed67c6db7c174b3c33bebcb689117fafa0f89f64c74619f9273c8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}